Package: tributary
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: dkoch <drkoch@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: clickhouse-server, clickhouse-client, jq, curl, ca-certificates, openssl, systemd, adduser
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://git.kochlabs.io/dkoch/tributary
Description: network flow analytics appliance (NetFlow, IPFIX, sFlow)
 Collects NetFlow v5/v9, IPFIX and sFlow v5 from routers, switches and
 firewalls, stores flows in ClickHouse and serves dashboards, a traffic
 explorer and flow search through an HTTPS web interface.
 .
 clickhouse-server comes from the ClickHouse apt repository
 (packages.clickhouse.com); deploy/install.sh adds it before installing.
